ion flaws are documented but may be managed. The alternatives either lack critical stress\u2011handling data (A, D) or have more pronounced interpersonal/development drawbacks (C).\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\u202fWe lack any evidence of A\u2019s or D\u2019s ability to manage stress and work effectively with crew; we also lack concrete evidence of how B\u2019s communication problems affect actual crew performance.\n**What would change my vote:**\u202fIf any agent can provide evidence that A or D possess strong stress\u2011handling and teamwork/communication abilities that outweigh their interpersonal flaws, or if evidence shows B\u2019s communication issues have led to operational failures, I would reassess my preference.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
